  "title": "The third-largest city by area",
  "text": "California City covers about 204 square miles, the third-largest land area of any city in California, behind San Diego and Los Angeles. Its plan included a central park with a 26-acre manmade lake and two golf courses. When it incorporated in 1965, it had 5,900 landowners but only 817 residents.",
